{"id":28429,"slug":"il-sorpasso","title":"Il sorpasso","year":1962,"country":"Italy","duration":105,"spine":707,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/28429-il-sorpasso","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/41d9df20fc245c4ecc12ef934533adc2/HrfTWPnllatTkm1Npqwr0o4Jslre1h_large.jpg","description":"The ultimate Italian road comedy, Il sorpasso stars the unlikely pair of Vittorio Gassman and Jean-Louis Trintignant as, respectively, a waggish, freewheeling bachelor and the straitlaced law student he takes on a madcap trip from Rome to Tuscany. An unpredictable journey that careers from slapstick to tragedy, this film, directed by Dino Risi, is a wildly entertaining commentary on the pleasures and consequences of the good life. A holy grail of commedia all’italiana, Il sorpasso is so fresh and exciting that one can easily see why it has long been adored in Italy.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Dino Risi","slug":"dino-risi"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Vittorio Gassman","role":"Bruno Cortona","slug":"vittorio-gassman"},{"actor":"Jean-Louis Trintignant","role":"Roberto Mariani","slug":"jean-louis-trintignant"},{"actor":"Catherine Spaak","role":"Lilli Cortona","slug":"catherine-spaak"},{"actor":"Claudio Gora","role":"Bibi","slug":"claudio-gora"},{"actor":"Luciana Angiolillo","role":"Gianna","slug":"luciana-angiolillo"}],"credits":[{"role":"Director","person":"Dino Risi","slug":"dino-risi"},{"role":"Story and screenplay","person":"Dino Risi","slug":"dino-risi"},{"role":"Story and screenplay","person":"Ettore Scola","slug":"ettore-scola"},{"role":"Story and screenplay","person":"Ruggero Maccari","slug":null},{"role":"Dialogue","person":"Ettore Scola","slug":"ettore-scola"},{"role":"Dialogue","person":"Ruggero Maccari","slug":null},{"role":"Produced by","person":"Mario Cecchi Gori","slug":null},{"role":"Cinematography","person":"Alfio Contini","slug":null},{"role":"Music","person":"Riz Ortolani","slug":null},{"role":"Editing","person":"Maurizio Luc